{"n":84,"level":"A2","title":"Giving advice: should","pt":"Dando conselhos: should","scene":"park","tod":"day","cast":["Naomi","Oscar","Pog"],"fic":{"scene":"park","tod":"day","decor":[],"cast":[{"p":{"hs":"side","outfit":"shirt","top":"#ee7fa8","hair":"brown","skin":"deep","arms":"wave"}},{"p":{"hs":"side","outfit":"shirt","top":"#6d7fcc","hair":"brown","skin":"tan","arms":"point"}},{"p":{"hs":"spiky","outfit":"shirt","top":"#7b5cf0","hair":"blue","skin":"light","arms":"out"}}]},"minutes":64,"slides":[{"t":"cover","min":1,"title":"Giving advice: should","pt":"Dando conselhos: should","level":"A2","n":84,"cast":["Naomi","Oscar","Pog"]},{"t":"goals","min":1,"goal":"Dar e pedir conselhos.","canDo":["Usar should / shouldn't","Perguntar What should I do?","Dar conselhos educados"]},{"t":"warm","min":2,"q":"Que conselho você daria a quem quer aprender inglês?","pt":"Colete ideias.","chips":["What should I do?","You should sleep more.","You shouldn't work so much.","Why don't you take a walk?"]},{"t":"curious","min":1,"title":"Dar conselhos","text":"'Should' é o jeito mais comum de aconselhar. Para suavizar: 'Why don't you…?' ou 'You might want to…'. 'If I were you, I'd…' também é muito usado.","kind":"Você sabia?"},{"t":"scene","min":1,"text":"Oscar está estressado e pede conselhos a Naomi no parque.","line":"I'm very stressed, Naomi. What should I do?","who":["Naomi","Oscar","Pog"]},{"t":"article","min":2,"title":"A walk in the park","text":"Oscar works too much. He sleeps five hours a night and drinks seven coffees a day. \"I'm very stressed,\" he tells Naomi. Naomi gives him advice: \"You should sleep more, walk every day and drink less coffee.\" Oscar tries it. After two weeks, he feels different. He sleeps eight hours, walks for thirty minutes and drinks two coffees. He smiles more and works better. He tells Naomi, \"Your advice changed my life.\" Naomi says, \"It was your decision to follow it.\"","pt":"Os conselhos de Naomi mudam a rotina e o humor de Oscar.","qs"